-- Name: FUNCTION sp_get_policy_group_apply_list(i_group_id bigint); Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: cppoltp
--

COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.sp_get_policy_group_apply_list(i_group_id bigint) IS '
@brief [SWP-SCI1044] 그룹 정책별 적용 현황
